title: How a diagram reaches a reply
width: 200
node brief: Claude's brief | excalidraw fence
node wait: the card waits | drawing…
node spec: Sonnet's spec | .flow
node draw: the renderer | render.mjs
node done: the card redraws | PNG or cells

panel In the reply
  brief
  wait
  brief -> wait

panel In the background
  brief, spec
  done, draw
  brief -> spec
  spec -> draw
  draw -> done
